      "writtenOn": "2024-11-21T20:22:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Per the internal discussion thread with Chrome\u0027s Mac developers, Dawn\u0027s bots aren\u0027t set up to be able to reference the constant MTLGPUFamilyApple8 right now. To work around this I suggest using `reinterpret_cast\u003cMTLGPUFamily\u003e(1008)` and a big comment that this is a workaround for the inability to reference the MTLGPUFamilyApple8 enum on Dawn\u0027s build bots because they\u0027re building with a too-old Mac SDK. This workaround could also be #ifdef\u0027d but I don\u0027t think it\u0027s worth the complexity.",
      "revId": "36a103571f75221dae82c5895002522001d306a3",
